=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Horatius} inside of the Trader's Home at (I-9) in {z:Bastok Markets}, who sends you to {z:Dangruf Wadi}.
** The monsters in the area around the ??? are level 90-95. Only the Goblins are aggressive and they can be avoided with just {s:Invisible} since they do not have pets.
*** You will lose Invisible when riding the geyser (I-8) at {z:Dangruf Wadi}, so Field Support from the Grounds Tome will fail. Refer to {p:Invisible (Status)} for other options.

* Inside {z:Dangruf Wadi}, head to the (I-5)/(J-5) boundary, where you'll find a ??? during sunny weather.
** Sunny weather is the default weather with no icon. If there is a weather at the time you're attempting this quest, you will have to wait for it to clear up to find the ???.
** You receive the {@i:Dangruf Stone|553} {i:Dangruf Stone|Dangruf Stone|553} after choosing the dialog option to check the area.

* Head back to {n:Horatius} for your reward of 400g.

